  body: "# Source scope and change history\n\nThese records are catalogued for provenance. Their pages
    are not mixed into the default current-topic search corpus.\n\n- **DMG Vol 13 Ch 80: Transitional
    provisions** — transitional; 14 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a802f86ed915d74e33f8f3f/dmgch80.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13 Ch 81: This chapter is spare ** — spare; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7c8a72ed915d6969f45992/dmg-vol13-ch81-blank.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13 Ch 82: This chapter is spare ** — spare; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7c8c4c40f0b626628acd62/dmg-vol13-ch82-blank.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Summary of changes from December 2020** — change-history; 4 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1030420b52e4144868956/dmg-v-13-summary-of-changes.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 46, June 2020** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 1 PDF pages. [Official
    source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5ede301ad3bf7f2ca42c697e/dmg-amends-summary-june20-vol13.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 45, February 2020** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 1 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e45665840f0b677c3e37fc7/v13am45.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 44, October 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 71 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5dbad983e5274a4aa55a0a29/vol-13-amd-44-oct-2019.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 43, June 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 70 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d12009aed915d3200001b47/vol13am43.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 42, February 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 124 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5caf489fe5274a59c06bf111/vol13am42.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 41, October 2018** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 16 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5c5023c2e5274a4934b11e2e/v13am41.pdf).\n\
