    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8211deed915d74e62359f3/v13am39.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 38, October 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 22 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a74dc1ee5274a3cb2867c34/v13am38.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 37, June 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 40 PDF pages.
    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a81636ced915d74e6231fcd/v13am37.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 36, February 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 32 PDF pages.
