    [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e456b37ed915d4ffed119ca/vol14am50.pdf).\n\
    - **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 49, June 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 4 PDF pages. [Official
    source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d120102ed915d3200001b48/vol14am49.pdf).\n\
