    \nSavings credit\n\nSavings credit threshold (see DMG 77356)\n9 Amount of SCT from 8.04.13\n\n\n1.
    Claimant who has no partner £115.30\n\n\n2. Claimant who has a partner £183.90\n\n\n3. Polygamous
    marriage cases £183.90\n\n\nPrescribed percentages\n10 Prescribed percentages from 8.04.13\n\n\nFor
    the purposes of determining\n\n\n1. The MSC (see DMG 77363) 60%\n\n\n2. Amount A (see DMG 77371 2.)
    60%\n\n\n3. Amount B (see DMG 77373 1.) 40%\n\n\nMaximum savings credit from 8.04.13\n11 The MSC is
