    percentage is 60%.\n\n\nSo from 8.04.13 the amount of the MSC is as follows\n\n\n1. claimant with
    no partner £145.40 SMG - £115.30 SCT x 60% = £18.06\n\n\n2. claimant with a partner £222.05 SMG -
