    who has a partner £229.67\n\n\n3. Polygamous marriage cases £229.67\n\n\nPrescribed percentages\n\
    40 Prescribed percentages from 8.04.19\n\n\nFor the purposes of determining\n\n\n1. The MSC (see DMG
    77363) 60%\n\n\n2. Amount A (see DMG 77371 2.) 60%\n\n\n3. Amount B (see DMG 77373 1.) 40%\n\n\nMaximum
    savings credit from 8.04.19\n41 The MSC is a fixed percentage of the difference between the SMG and
    the SCT (see DMG 77363).\nFrom 8.04.19, that percentage is 60%.\n\n\nSo from 8.04.19 the amount of
    the MSC is as follows\n\n\n1. claimant with no partner £167.25 SMG - £148.38 SCT x 60% = £13.70\n\n\
    \n2. claimant with a partner £255.25 SMG - £229.67 SCT x 60% = £15.35\n\n\n3. polygamous marriages
    £255.25 SMG - £229.67 SCT x 60% = £15.25\n\n\n4. prisoners Nil\n\n\n5. members of religious orders
    fully maintained by their order\n(see DMG 78680) Nil\n\n\n6. people in hospital - see DMG 78700.\n\
    \n```\n"
