    \n\n2. Carer £42.75\n\n\n3. Transitional amount for former claimants of IS/JSA(IB) - see DMG 78120\n\
    \n\n4. Housing costs - see DMG 78170 et seq.\n\n\n\nSavings credit\n\nSavings credit threshold (see
    DMG 77356)\n59 Amount of SCT from 10.04.23\n\n\n1. Claimant who has no partner £174.49\n\n```\n"
