    \                               £60\n\n\n SPC                                       £9.70\n\n\nTotal
    weekly income is                     £196.95\n\n\n\nExample 6: Single - Income between SCT and AMG\n\
    \nUlrika is aged 66 and lives alone. She is entitled to RP of £79.60 a week and S2P of £10. Ulrika
    qualifies\nfor an additional amount of £44.15 a week because she is severely disabled (see DMG 78040
    et seq).\n\n\nCalculation of GC:\n\n```\n"
