    \n\nCalculation of SC:\n\n\n SCT                                  £79.60\n\n\n QI                \
    \                   £89.60\n\n\n QI exceeds SCT by                    £10\n\n\n 60% x £10        \
    \                    £6\n\n\n MSC                                  £15.511\n\n\n Amount A        \
    \                     £6\n\n\n Amount B (income does not exceed     Nil\n AMG)\n\n\n Amount of SC\
    \                         £6\n\n\nTotal SPC payable                     £66.00\n\n\nCalculation of
    total weekly income:\n\n\n RP                                   £79.60\n\n\n S2P                 \
    \                 £10\n\n\n SPC                                  £66.00\n\n\nTotal weekly income is\
    \                £144.60\n\n```\n"
