  type: Source PDF page
  description: 'Example 7: Single - Income less than AMG Carlos, who is aged 70, is severely disabled
    and lives alone. He is entitled to basic RP of £79.60 and has £3 a week assumed income from capital
    (see DMG Chapter 84). Carlos qualifies for an addition'
  body: "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount
    payable — PDF page 77\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=77).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nExample 7: Single - Income less than AMG\n\nCarlos,
    who is aged 70, is severely disabled and lives alone. He is entitled to basic RP of £79.60 and has\n\
    £3 a week assumed income from capital (see DMG Chapter 84). Carlos qualifies for an additional amount\n\
    of £44.15 a week because he is severely disabled (see DMG 78040 et seq).\n\n\nCalculation of GC:\n\
    \n\n SMG                                         £105.45\n\n\n Additional amounts                \
    \          £44.15\n\n\n AMG                                         £149.60\n\n\n Less income (£79.60
    + £3)                   £82.60\n\n\n Amount of GC                                £67.00\n\n\nCalculation
    of SC:\n\n\n SCT                                         £79.60\n\n\n QI                         \
    \                 £82.60\n\n\n QI exceeds SCT by                           £3\n\n\n 60% x £3     \
    \                               £1.80\n\n\n MSC                                         £15.51\n\n\
    \n Amount A                                    £1.80\n\n\n Amount B (income does not exceed      \
    \      Nil\n AMG)\n\n\n Amount of SC                                £1.80\n\n\nTotal SPC payable \
    \                           £68.80\n\n\nCalculation of total weekly income:\n\n\n RP             \
    \                             £79.60\n\n\n Assumed income from capital                 £3\n\n```\n"
