    \                            £7.59\n\n\nTotal weekly income is                  £213.09\n\n\n\nExample
    12: Couple - Mixed income types in payment\n\nIna, who is 70, has RP of £79.60 and a personal pension
    of £40. Her partner Jamie gets IB of £55.90 and\nWDisP of £30. Jamie’s IB is not QI and £10 of his
    WDisP is disregarded in the calculation of income (see\nDMG Chapter 85). Ina qualifies for an additional
    amount for housing costs (see DMG Chapter 78) of £30.\n\n```\n"
