    or\n\n\n2. aged less than 25 and has earned income\n\n\na deduction at the rate described in Appendix
    1 will be appropriate.\n\n\n78523\n\n\n\nCalculation of a non-dependant’s gross weekly income\n\n\
    78524 [see DMG memo 02/25][See Memo DMG 04-25] [See Memo DMG 06/25] [See Memo DMG 08-\n25] When calculating
    the gross weekly income of a non-dependant (see DMG 78515 and Appendix 1 to\n\nthis Chapter), disregard1
    any\n\n\n1. “AA”\n\n\n2. DLA\n\n\n3. PIP\n\n\n4. ADP\n\n\n5. AFIP\n\n\n6. payments made under, or
    derived from\n\n\n         6.1 the Macfarlane Trust\n\n\n         6.2 the Macfarlane (Special Payments)
