    DMG 78614 1. is not satisfied if either partner or any additional spouse is\n\ntreated as being in
    receipt of “AA” or DLA or PIP or AFIP as in DMG 78059 2.1. In such a case the lower\nrate of additional
    amount should be considered.\n\n\n                                                               \
