    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nFree in-patient treatment 78720 - 78754\n\n\n\n\
    Deciding free in-patient treatment 78720 - 78721\n\n\nMaintained free of charge 78722 - 78724\n\n\n\
    Medical or other treatment 78725 - 78730\n\n\nHospital or similar institution 78731 - 78737\n\n\n\
