  description: Absence from Great Britain 78920 - 78939 78920 It is a condition of entitlement to
    SPC that a person is in GB1. But entitlement can sometimes continue during an absence from GB2.
    Guidance on entitlement to SPC when a person is absent from G
  body: "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 138\n\
    \n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=138).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nAbsence from Great Britain 78920 - 78939\n\n78920\
    \    It is a condition of entitlement to SPC that a person is in GB1. But entitlement can sometimes\n\
    \ncontinue during an absence from GB2. Guidance on entitlement to SPC when a person is absent from
    GB\nis given in DMG Chapter 07 paragraphs 077001 - 077029.\n\n\n                1 SPC Act 02, s 1(2)(a)
    & (5)(a); SPC Regs, reg 2 & 4; 2 SPC Act, s 1(5)(b); SPC Regs, reg 3\n\n\n78921 - 78939\n\n```\n"
