    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nAppendix 1 - Housing costs - amount of non-dependant
    deductions\n[See Memo DMG 02/26]\n\n\nRates from 6.4.18\n\n\nRates from 8.4.19\n\n\nRates from 6.4.20\n\
    \n\nRates from 12.4.21\n\n\nRates from 11.4.22\n\n\nRates from 10.4.23\n\n\nRates from 8.4.24\n\n\n\
    Rates from 7.4.25\n\n\nThis appendix provides details of the rates of the non-dependant deductions
