    1. non-dependants aged 18 or over are in remunerative work - £98.30\n\n\n2. the DM is satisfied that
    the non-dependant in remunerative work has a gross weekly income of\n\n\n2.1 Less than £139.00   \
    \  £15.25\n\n\n2.2 £139.00 to £203.99 £35.00\n\n\n2.3 £204.00 to £264.99 £48.05\n\n\n2.4 £265.00 to
