  title: Chapter 78 — PDF page 175
  type: Source PDF page
  description: 'Calculation of total weekly income: Total RP £206.85 SPC £73.97 Total weekly income is
    £280.82 Example 3 - Additional amount for carers Sanjay, who is aged 65, is a member of a polygamous
    marriage and is married to Gita and Bina. Sanjay is '
  body: "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 175\n\
    \n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=175).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nCalculation of total weekly income:\n\n\nTotal RP\
    \                 £206.85\n\n\nSPC                      £73.97\n\n\nTotal weekly income is £280.82\n\
    \n\n\nExample 3 - Additional amount for carers\n\nSanjay, who is aged 65, is a member of a polygamous
    marriage and is married to Gita and Bina. Sanjay is\nentitled to RP of £127.25 a week and Bina gets
    RP of £79.60 a week. Both Gita and Bina are entitled to\nCA and each satisfy the conditions for the
    award of an additional amount for carers.\n\n\nCalculation of GC:\n\n\nSMG for Sanjay and his eldest
    wife      £160.95\nGita\n\n\nSMG for additional spouse Bina          £55.50\n\n\nAdditional amounts
    (£25.55 x 2)         £51.10\n\n\nAMG                                     £267.55\n\n\nLess income
    (£79.60 + £127.25)          £206.85\n\n\nAmount of GC                            £60.70\n\n\nCalculation
    of SC:\n\n\nSCT                                        £127.25\n\n\nQI                           \
    \              £206.85\n\n\nQI exceeds SCT by                          £79.60\n\n\n60% x £79.60  \
    \                             £47.76\n\n\nMSC                                        £20.22\n\n\n\
    Amount A                                   £47.76\n\n\nAmount B (income does not exceed AMG) Nil\n\
    \n```\n"
