    \  b. Installation of communal heating systems                      - Yes\n\n\n                  \
    \                                                                      Yes if not\n              \
    \     a. Estate lighting                                               -\n                       \
    \                                                                 provision\n\n\n                \
    \   b. Controlled access and security                                - Yes\n\n\n                 \
    \  c. Repairs to estate roads or paths                              - Yes\nEstate works\n\n      \
    \             d. Provision and refurbishment of recreational areas             - Yes\n\n\n       \
    \            e. Landscaping                                                   - Yes\n\n\n        \
    \           f. Boundary walls and fences                                     - Yes\n\n\n         \
    \          Costs essential to the works, which may include:                 --\n\n\n             \
    \      a. Surveys                                                           Yes\n\n\n            \
    \       b. Preliminaries e.g. site set up costs                              Yes\nAssociated costs\n\
    \                   c. Fees                                                              Yes\n\n\n\
    \                   d. Access equipment e.g. scaffolding                                 Yes\n\n\n\
    \                   e. Health and safety                                                 Yes\n\n```\n"
