    £1.00 per week\n\n79055 Where the amount of SPC payable is less than £1.00 per week, the Secretary
    of State may direct\n\nthat it is paid at an interval other than weekly. This interval should not
    exceed 13 weeks 1.\n\n\n                                                                         \
    \        1 SS (C&P) Regs, reg 26B(5)\n\n\n\nSPC of less than 10p per week\n\n79056 SPC is not payable
