  body: "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions  — PDF page 10\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf#page=10).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
