    The total amount paid to George for this period is\n£47.20.\n\n\n\nPayments of SPC for less than a
    full week in other circumstances\n\n79106 Payments of SPC may be made for a period of less than a
    full week where 1\n\n\n1. a claimant in receipt of SPC is awarded another social security benefit
