  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods — PDF page 11\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf#page=11).\n\
