  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods — PDF page 15\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf#page=15).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n             W h e n will a n AI P e n d\n83050\
    \        A n AI P of a n y l e n gt h will e n d at a n y ti m e at w hi c h\n                   \
    \                                                                                 1\n            \
    \ 1.       t h e cl ai m a nt b e c o m e s a m e m b er of a c o u pl e\n                       \
