  type: Source PDF page
  description: 'DMG Chapter 84: Deemed weekly income from capital Subpages • Introduction 84001 - 84010
    • The general rules 84011 - 84020 • Is the resource capital 84021 - 84070 • Does the person own the
    capital 84071 - 84120 • Beneficial ownership in part'
  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital — PDF page 1\n\n[Verify the official PDF
    page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=1).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nDMG Chapter 84: Deemed weekly income from capital\n\
    \n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Introduction 84001 - 84010\n  • The general rules 84011 - 84020\n  • Is the
    resource capital 84021 - 84070\n  • Does the person own the capital 84071 - 84120\n  • Beneficial
    ownership in particular cases 84121 - 84350\n  • Can the capital be disregarded 84351 - 84356\n  •
    Capital disregarded indefinitely 84357 - 84520\n  • Capital disregarded for up to two years 84521
    - 84560\n  • Capital disregarded for a year or longer 84561 - 84600\n  • Capital disregarded for 26
    weeks or longer 84601 - 84670\n  • Capital disregarded for the remainder of an award of SPC 84671
    - 84690\n  • What is the value of the capital 84691 - 84700\n  • Further guidance on valuation 84701
    - 84730\n  • Valuation in particular cases 84731 - 84775\n  • Notional capital 84776 - 84780\n  •
    Deprivation of capital 84781 - 84820\n  • People treated as sole owner or partner in a company 84821
    - 84830\n  • What is the amount of notional capital 84831 - 84910\n  • Deemed weekly income from capital
    84911 - 84999\n  • Appendix 1 - How to work out deemed weekly income from capital (DMG 84911)\n\n\
    ```\n"
