  description: 2. person “A” who passes it onto the claimant but only where person “A” 2.1 was
    formerly in the claimant’s care 2.2 is aged 16 or over and 2.3 continues to live with the
    claimant2. 1 Children (Scotland) Act 95, s 26A; 2 SPC Regs, Sch V, Par
  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital — PDF page 58\n\n[Verify the official PDF
