  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital — PDF page 79\n\n[Verify the official PDF
    page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=79).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
