  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 24\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=24).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nOn 1.10.04 no payment of SSP is either made, or
    treated as made, so no SSP is taken into account from\nBWC 4.10.04.\n\n```\n"
