    Regs, reg 15\n\n\n85281 The following are fully disregarded as benefit income1 but should be taken
    into account as\n\nearnings2 (see DMG Chapter 86).\n\n\n1. statutory adoption pay (see DMG 85320)\n\
    \n\n2. SMP (see DMG 85321)\n\n\n3. statutory paternity pay (see DMG 85322)\n\n\n4. statutory shared
    parental pay (see DMG 85324)\n\n\n5. SSP (see DMG 85323).\n\n\n                                  \
    \                                        1 SPC Regs, reg 15; 2 reg 17A(2)\n\n\n85282 Any benefit similar
    to those mentioned in DMG 85280 - 85281 payable under legislation having\n\neffect in Northern Ireland
    is also disregarded when calculating income for SPC 1.\n\n\n                                     \
    \                                               1 SPC Regs, reg 15(1)(s)\n\n```\n"
