  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 70\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=70).\n\
