  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 98\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=98).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nRetirement pension income available on application
    85440 - 85499\n\n\n\nGeneral 85440\n\n\nRetirement pension - notional income 85441 - 85442\n\n\nState
    Pension – notional income 85443 - 85444\n\n\nDeferring retirement pension 85445 - 85446\n\n\nOccupational
    pension schemes - notional income 85453\n\n\nPersonal pensions 85454 - 85464\n\n\nMeaning of money
    purchase benefits 85465\n\n\nWhat is a pension fund holder 85466\n\n\nWho is a person who derives
    entitlement 85467 - 85468\n\n\nInformation and evidence 85469 - 85471\n\n\nLump sums on retirement\
    \       85472 - 85475\n\n\nActual income 85476\n\n\nProvision under a retirement annuity contract
    85477\n\n\nRetirement annuity contract - notional income 85478 - 85499\n\n\n\n\nGeneral\n\n85440 There
    are special rules for treating retirement pension income\n\n\n1. that would be paid to the claimant
    if he applied for it and\n\n\n2. that has not been applied for\n\n\nas notional income1.\n\n\n   \
    \                                                                    1 SPC Regs, reg 18(1)-(5)\n\n\
    ```\n"
