  title: Chapter 86 — PDF page 40
  type: Source PDF page
  description: 'Payments on termination of employment 86150 - 86199 General 86150 - 86152 Payments in
    lieu of remuneration 86153 - 86155 Payments in lieu of notice 86156 - 86159 Holiday pay 86160 - 86161
    Statutory redundancy payments 86162 - 86169 General '
  body: "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 40\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=40).\n\
    \n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not
    establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nPayments on termination of employment 86150 - 86199\n\
    \n\n\nGeneral 86150 - 86152\n\n\nPayments in lieu of remuneration 86153 - 86155\n\n\nPayments in lieu
    of notice 86156 - 86159\n\n\nHoliday pay 86160 - 86161\n\n\nStatutory redundancy payments 86162 -
    86169\n\n\n\n\nGeneral\n\n86150 Any earnings derived from employment which ended before the day that
    the claimant first\n\nsatisfies the conditions of entitlement to an award of SPC should be disregarded
    in full 1. But this\ndisregard does not apply to the payments described at DMG 86062.The disregard
    can apply to\nsuccessive awards of SPC.\n\n\n                                                    \
    \                              1 SPC Regs, Sch VI, para 6\n\n\nExample\n\n\nCharles’ employment ends
    on 1.6.15. He claims and is entitled to an award of SPC from 2.6.15. The DM\ncan apply the disregard
    in DMG 86150 to earnings derived from that employment. At a later stage\nCharles’ award of SPC comes
    to an end because he starts a new job and his earnings exceed the AMG.\nAfter a few months, this second
    employment also comes to an end and Charles reclaims SPC for a\nsecond time. The DM can apply the
    disregard in DMG 86150 to earnings derived from this second\nemployment which has now just ended.\n\
    \n\n86151 Employees may be entitled to certain payments when their employment ends. These include\n\
    \n\n1. PILOR (see DMG 86153)\n\n\n2. PILON (see DMG 86156)\n\n\n3. holiday pay (see DMG 86070 and
    86160)\n\n\n4. statutory redundancy payments (see DMG 86162).\n\n```\n"
  generated:
    by: process:okf-dwp-build/0.1.0
    at: '2026-09-15T14:21:03Z'
