  description: Claimant's personal allowance - 1,220.39 (£4,895 x 91/365) (05/06 rates) = 14,279.61
    The first £521.06 £2,090 x - 52.10 91/365) at 10% The remainder (£13,758.55) at 3,026.88 22%
