    Tax Rates\n\n\n18/19          £11,850 – £13,850   at starter tax rate of 19%\n\n\n               £13,851
    – £24,000   at basic rate of 20%\n\n\n               £24,001 – £43,430   at intermediate rate of 21%\n\
