    \        monthly £3,488\n\n\nPrimary threshold\n\n\nNo contributions are payable on weekly earnings
    of £153 or less or monthly\nearnings of £663 or less. Otherwise contributions are still payable at
    a rate of 12%\nfor earnings between £153.01 and £805 per week and at 2% for earnings above\n£645 per
