- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/persona/applicant-change-reporter
  route: persona/applicant-change-reporter
  title: Applicant or change reporter
  type: Persona
  description: Projected user who needs a clear route through a first application or a separate
    report of changed circumstances.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - persona
  - projected-persona
  - owner-requested-need
  - OW02
  generated:
    by: process:codex-research-authoring
    at: '2026-09-15T16:53:17Z'
  body: "# Applicant or change reporter\n\nThis projected persona responds to the owner's request for
    application and change-of-circumstances journeys. It has not been validated through research with
    applicants.\n\nGoal: understand a plain-English next step, recognise missing information and reach
    the appropriate official service or human help. An initial application and a report of a change are
    separate scenario variants with separate triggers and completion criteria.\n\nAll evaluation cases
    are synthetic. This record does not establish official service steps, collect personal data or determine
    entitlement.\n\n\n[Research reference: Explore application and change journeys](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/apply-and-report-change.md)."
  id: persona/applicant-change-reporter
  '@type': schema:Role
  authority: model-assisted research navigation; unreviewed
  dcterms:references:
  - '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/story/apply-and-report-change
- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/persona/assisted-support
  route: persona/assisted-support
  title: Assisted support practitioner
  type: Persona
  description: Projected practitioner who helps a person navigate, understand and verify source
    information through an accessible route.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - persona
  - projected-persona
  - projected-need
  - OW02
  generated:
    by: process:codex-research-authoring
    at: '2026-09-15T16:53:17Z'
  body: "# Assisted support practitioner\n\nThis is a projected extension of the owner's customer-journey
    request, not an observed staff or claimant persona.\n\nGoal: support source discovery where a person
    needs help reading, navigating or using digital services. The person should be able to distinguish
    an unofficial explanation from the original and recognise when extraction is incomplete.\n\nKeyboard
    and assistive-technology task completion require direct evaluation. An automated retrieval success
    is not evidence that this person's needs have been met.\n\n\n[Research reference: Support accessible
    source discovery](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/assisted-discovery.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Explore application and change journeys](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/apply-and-report-change.md)."
  id: persona/assisted-support
  '@type': schema:Role
  authority: model-assisted research navigation; unreviewed
  dcterms:references:
  - '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/story/assisted-discovery
  - '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/story/apply-and-report-change
- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/persona/evidence-assurance-reviewer
  route: persona/evidence-assurance-reviewer
  title: Evidence assurance reviewer
  type: Persona
  description: Projected reviewer who distinguishes policy interpretation from additional
    operational evidence, fraud and error requirements.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - persona
  - projected-persona
  - staff-derived-need
  - ST03
  generated:
    by: process:codex-research-authoring
    at: '2026-09-15T16:53:17Z'
  body: "# Evidence assurance reviewer\n\nThis projected persona derives from the staff's statement that
    evidence requirements include an operational fraud and error layer beyond policy interpretation.\n\
    \nGoal: see which requirements are supported by supplied sources, which are proposed and which require
    an authorised owner. The persona does not supply an evidence checklist, a claimant risk model or a
    fraud detection method.\n\nPolicy, operational evidence, privacy, fraud and error specialists must
    review requirements within their remit. No real claimant data is needed for this evaluation.\n\n\n\
    [Research reference: Separate policy and operational evidence needs](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/evidence-requirements.md)."
  id: persona/evidence-assurance-reviewer
  '@type': schema:Role
  authority: model-assisted research navigation; unreviewed
  dcterms:references:
  - '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/story/evidence-requirements
