  route: question/stage2-001
  title: What evidence distinguishes guidance from legal interpretation?
  type: Question
  description: 'Proposed evaluation J01: Trace the capital-disregard entry point to captured guidance,
    visible legal references and unresolved dependencies.'
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - question
  - proposed-evaluation
  - not-executed
  - J01
