- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/story/adviser-comparison
  route: story/adviser-comparison
  title: Design a controlled adviser and calculator comparison
  type: UserStory
  description: As an adviser, I want a common synthetic scenario and explicit source coverage so
    that I can investigate differences without assuming which tool is correct.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
