- '@id': https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/story/apply-and-report-change
  route: story/apply-and-report-change
  title: Explore application and change journeys
  type: UserStory
  description: As an applicant or change reporter, I want a clear next step for my journey so that I
    can find official help without an unsupported entitlement decision.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - userstory
  - proposed-evaluation
  - owner-requested-need
  - OW02
  - OW01
  - J05
  generated:
    by: process:codex-research-authoring
    at: '2026-09-15T16:53:17Z'
  body: "# Explore application and change journeys\n\nProposed journey J05, addressing owner request OW02.
    Evaluate two separate variants: an initial application and a report of a changed household circumstance
    with an event date.\n\nAcceptance: retain different triggers and completion criteria, accessible explanations,
    known gaps and a verified official hand-off. Official service steps and operational evidence requirements
    need further discovery; concept links are starting points only.\n\nUse synthetic cases. Do not collect
    real personal data, submit an application, calculate an award or infer Pension Credit entitlement
    from Universal Credit eligibility guidance. Service, policy and user research review remain outstanding.\n\
    \n\n[Research reference: Applicant or change reporter](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/persona/applicant-change-reporter.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Assisted support practitioner](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/persona/assisted-support.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: State Pension Credit](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/pension-credit.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Membership of the household](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/household.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Part-week payments](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/part-week-payments.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: How do application and change journeys need to differ?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/stage2-005.md)."
  id: story/apply-and-report-change
  '@type': schema:CreativeWork
  authority: model-assisted research navigation; unreviewed
  dcterms:references:
