    at: '2026-09-15T16:53:17Z'
  body: "# Separate policy and operational evidence needs\n\nProposed journey J03, addressing staff need
    ST03. Use an invented report of changed household circumstances to identify policy topics and operational
    evidence gaps.\n\nAcceptance: distinguish source-backed, stakeholder-derived and unresolved requirements.
    Record which authorised role must review operational requirements; do not infer a mandatory identity
    document or risk score from policy text.\n\nThe scenario contains no real claimant information. Operational
    evidence, fraud and error, privacy and policy review remain outstanding.\n\n\n[Research reference:
    Evidence assurance reviewer](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/persona/evidence-assurance-reviewer.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Membership of the household](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/household.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Spot historical and missing context](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/context-review.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Which evidence requirements remain operational questions?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/stage2-003.md)."
