    at: '2026-09-15T16:53:17Z'
  body: "# Review an evidence-backed rule candidate\n\nProposed journey J02, addressing staff need ST02
    and evaluating model proposal MP01. Inspect one bounded capital-related candidate, retaining any missing
    stages as gaps.\n\nAcceptance: identify supporting source bytes, assumptions, conditions, exceptions,
    temporal scope, proposed rule and independent synthetic tests. Record review status separately from
    successful parsing or retrieval.\n\nNegative controls include a changed source hash and an incorrectly
    reused historical rate. Policy and engineering review are required before executable use. This story
    is not an entitlement algorithm.\n\n\n[Research reference: Rules architect](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/persona/rules-architect.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Capital disregards](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/capital-disregards.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Audit a source transformation](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/evidence-audit.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: What is missing before a candidate rule could be implemented?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/stage2-002.md)."
