  body: "# Additional amounts\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation
    or entitlement decision.\n\nFind the chapter covering additional amounts and special groups.\n\nSource:
    [DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups , PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=3).\n\
    \nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos.
    Source SHA-256: `d5e17de1d343fc6a6498089897b222a4989914fa53f85af9ddc8c9c05471e2b8`.\n\n\n[Research
    reference: DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/78.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Chapter 78 — PDF page 3](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/78/0003.md).\n\
    \n**Proposed relationship:** has related concept [Severe disability](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/severe-disability.md).
    The introduction lists this subject under additional amounts. Association is not evidence that an
    individual qualifies. Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** has related concept
    [Carers](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/carers.md). The introduction
    lists this subject under additional amounts. Association is not evidence that an individual qualifies.
    Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** has related concept [Housing costs](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/housing-costs.md).
    The introduction lists this subject under additional amounts. Association is not evidence that an
    individual qualifies. Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** has related concept
    [Children and qualifying young people](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/children.md).
    The introduction lists this subject under additional amounts. Association is not evidence that an
    individual qualifies. Specialist review required."
