    title: 'DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital'
  body: "# Beneficial ownership of capital\n\nThe chapter distinguishes a beneficial interest in capital
    from the name in which capital is held. This concept records that distinction for source review, without
    deciding ownership in a case.\n\nProject-authored interpretation awaiting specialist review. Evidence:
