  route: term/capital-disregards
  title: Capital disregards
  type: Concept
  description: Find opening disregard provisions, legislation citations and the referenced DMG memo.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - concept
  resource:
    https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35
  sources:
  - id: dmg-vol14-ch84
    resource:
      https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35
    title: 'DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital'
    author: organisation:dwp
  body: "# Capital disregards\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation
    or entitlement decision.\n\nFind opening disregard provisions, legislation citations and the referenced
    DMG memo.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital, PDF page 35](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35).\n\
    \nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos.
    Source SHA-256: `f5c610b29bdb81e11736409b7f33ccf7917a4d8945f2821802801073e0d753ee`.\n\n\n[Research
    reference: DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/84.md).\n\
    \n[Research reference: Chapter 84 — PDF page 35](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/84/0035.md).\n\
    \n**Proposed relationship:** has related concept [Capital](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/capital.md).
    The source explicitly frames disregards as special treatment of capital; this association does not
    identify every qualifying asset. Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** has evidence
    requirement [Evidence for a capital disregard](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/capital-disregard-evidence.md).
    The source describes a need to establish evidence for a disregard; operational evidence handling remains
    to be agreed. Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** has disregard period [Period
    of a capital disregard](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/capital-disregard-period.md).
    The source separates duration categories from the existence of a disregard; no default duration is
    assigned. Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** precedes assessment of [Valuation
    of capital](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/capital-valuation.md).
    This models the sequence described by this captured paragraph, not a complete executable decision
    procedure. Specialist review required.\n\n**Proposed relationship:** precedes assessment of [Deemed
    weekly income from capital](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/deemed-weekly-income.md).
    This models the sequence described by this captured paragraph, not a complete executable decision
    procedure. Specialist review required."
