    https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/activity/semantic-stage-two-2026-09-15
  confidence_score: 0.5
  review_status: unreviewed-specialist-review-required
  observed_at: '2026-09-15T16:57:46Z'
  evidence:
  - '@id':
      https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/evidence/semantic-authoring/068417af9a6f980e952780f92c1cbd72a161caa49425989aed726ebd00c90ff8
    type: authored-semantic-proposal
    url: https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/knowledge/concepts/capital.yamlld
    source_artifact: knowledge/concepts/capital.yamlld
    source_sha256: 462b5097b14192697ea73e41de1fbbc0219435737fcd17b4c4222d0581f2fa38
    source_field: term/capital.semantic_relations[0]
    source_value: '{"evidence":[{"locator":"DMG 84071–84073","page":"page/84/0008","quote":"84071 Only
      the capital which people are the beneficial owners of is included when working out what\ncapital
      they have.\n\n\n84072 People are beneficial owners of capital if they have a beneficial interest
      in it. A person is the joint\nbeneficial owner of capital if more than one person has a beneficial
      interest in the same capital.\n\n\n84073 A person whose name the capital is in is called the legal
      owner. A person is the joint legal owner of\ncapital if more than one person is the legal owner
      of the same capital."}],"predicate":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related","rationale":"The
      chapter distinguishes beneficial ownership from legal ownership when examining capital.","target":"term/beneficial-ownership"}'
    source_value_sha256: add58e5a3b67c571db82a3c0227213bae0bcb7d9ff8292ad195870c852a34ec0
    source_value_hash_canonicalization: utf8-verbatim
    locator: term/capital
    rationale: The chapter distinguishes beneficial ownership from legal ownership when examining
      capital.
    retrieved_at: '2026-09-15T16:57:46Z'
  - '@id':
      https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/evidence/semantic-passage/068417af9a6f980e952780f92c1cbd72a161caa49425989aed726ebd00c90ff8/0
    type: source-passage-for-model-proposal
    url: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=8
    source_artifact: source/pages/dmg-vol14-ch84.json
    source_sha256: bf1cc65d4b7521b7acb9193a212855e07a88d5a3ef03f5f9eaa74c3c222f39f5
    source_pdf_artifact: source/pdf/dmg-vol14-ch84.pdf
    source_pdf_sha256: f5c610b29bdb81e11736409b7f33ccf7917a4d8945f2821802801073e0d753ee
    source_page_route: page/84/0008
    source_field: pages[7].text
    source_value: "84071 Only the capital which people are the beneficial owners of is included when working
      out what\ncapital they have.\n\n\n84072 People are beneficial owners of capital if they have a beneficial
      interest in it. A person is the joint\nbeneficial owner of capital if more than one person has a
      beneficial interest in the same capital.\n\n\n84073 A person whose name the capital is in is called
      the legal owner. A person is the joint legal owner of\ncapital if more than one person is the legal
      owner of the same capital."
    source_value_sha256: 352373799eeb2e88d3021cc2db199d139394f108fc126df8a633d75dacb70923
    source_value_hash_canonicalization: utf8-verbatim
    locator: DMG 84071–84073
    retrieved_at: '2026-09-15T14:21:02Z'
