    source_value: '{"evidence":[{"locator":"DMG 78001","page":"page/78/0003","quote":"78001 This Chapter
      contains guidance on SPC and the\n\n\n1. additional amounts that may be awarded for\n\n\n      1.1
      the severely disabled (see DMG 78030)\n\n\n      1.2 carers (see DMG 78100)\n\n\n      1.3 former
