    source_field: pages[2].text
    source_value: "78001 This Chapter contains guidance on SPC and the\n\n\n1. additional amounts that
      may be awarded for\n\n\n      1.1 the severely disabled (see DMG 78030)\n\n\n      1.2 carers (see
      DMG 78100)\n\n\n      1.3 former claimants of IS/JSA(IB) (see DMG 78120)\n\n\n      1.4 housing
      costs (see DMG 78170)\n\n\n      1.5 those responsible for a child or qualifying young person (see
      DMG 78549)"
