    source_value: '{"evidence":[{"locator":"DMG 78001","page":"page/78/0003","quote":"78001 This Chapter
      contains guidance on SPC and the\n\n\n1. additional amounts that may be awarded for\n\n\n      1.1
      the severely disabled (see DMG 78030)\n\n\n      1.2 carers (see DMG 78100)\n\n\n      1.3 former
      claimants of IS/JSA(IB) (see DMG 78120)\n\n\n      1.4 housing costs (see DMG 78170)\n\n\n      1.5
      those responsible for a child or qualifying young person (see DMG 78549)"}],"predicate":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related","rationale":"The
      introduction lists this subject under additional amounts. Association is not evidence that an individual
      qualifies.","target":"term/severe-disability"}'
